# Copy this file to .env (already git-ignored) for settings that belong to the machine, not to one host.
# Loaded automatically at startup via python-dotenv (TopologyBuilder's
# Settings module does this on import) - no extra flag needed.
#
# ESXi and GNS3 passwords do NOT go here: they are stored per host in the host settings (Credentials section).
# The Operator no longer reads ESXI_PASSWORD/GNS3_PASSWORD from the environment (the TopologyBuilder command line
# still does).
